    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Innocence Rewrite&quot; is a visual novel developed by Charlotte's Oak. The game advances through mouse clicks and choices made by the player, with around 250,000 words of text. It features multiple endings, offering players the opportunity to shape the story based on their decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Synopsis</strong><br>With only eighteen days left until the college entrance exam, the air conditioning in the classroom feels unbearably cold.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yang Qingyin and his childhood friend, Lei Chuyi, have grown closer again, both preparing for the final stretch of their exam preparation together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One sweltering afternoon, Yang Qingyin unexpectedly reunites with his once-admired &quot;white moonlight,&quot; Hu Yifan.<br>&quot;The girl who opened the door under the setting sun while being chased by security&quot; once again steps into his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Innocence Rewrite&quot; is a visual novel developed by Charlotte's Oak. The game advances through mouse clicks and choices made by the player, with around 250,000 words of text. It features multiple endings, offering players the opportunity to shape the story based on their decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Synopsis</strong><br>With only eighteen days left until the college entrance exam, the air conditioning in the classroom feels unbearably cold.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yang Qingyin and his childhood friend, Lei Chuyi, have grown closer again, both preparing for the final stretch of their exam preparation together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One sweltering afternoon, Yang Qingyin unexpectedly reunites with his once-admired &quot;white moonlight,&quot; Hu Yifan.<br>&quot;The girl who opened the door under the setting sun while being chased by security&quot; once again steps into his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Innocence Rewrite&quot; captures the summer before and after the college entrance exam.As old bonds mend and distant feelings return, it's a season of healing amid chaos.No need for correction fluid \u2014 just feel, and slowly rewrite the innocence of youth.",
